      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "The proof says each composite K has rank at most M, then states that the reference-side Schmidt-support projection P_K has rank at most M without showing the link. Since η_K=(I_R⊗K)φ lies in H_R⊗ran(K), its reference Schmidt support has dimension at most dim ran(K)≤M. This omitted basis argument is immediate, so the gap is nonfatal.",
